{"sourceUrl":"https://nasa.jlu.edu.cn/info/1082/6209.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:29.190524+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://nasa.jlu.edu.cn/info/1082/6209.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为促进高校优秀大学生之间的交流，加深青年学生对东北亚政治、经济与社会</span></span><span><span>研究</span></span><span><span>前沿成果的了解，吸引</span></span><span><span>具有创新潜质的</span></span><span><span>优秀本科生到东北亚学院攻读硕士学位，我院将举办</span><span>“2025年校园学术</span></span><span><span>开放日</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>活动</span></span><span><span>，具体安排如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一、</span></span><span><span>日程安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>东北亚学院</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>校园学术</span></span><span><span>开放日</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>活动将于</span><span>2025年7月</span></span><span><span>上旬</span></span><span><span>开展，采用</span></span><span><span>线下宣讲</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>考核（考生须到学院参加考核）</span></span><span><span>方式</span></span><span><span>，主要活动包括</span></span><span><span>校园参观</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>学院及学科介绍、个人学术能力展示、</span></span><span><span>青年学者面对面交流</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>专业素养</span></span><span><span>考核等。具体日程安排请关注后续通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>在活动中学术能力考核合格</span></span><span><span>并具备所在学校</span><span>2026年硕士研究生“推荐免试资格”的学生，考核成绩可以做为推免阶段的重要参考依据。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、申请条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，愿</span></span><span><span>意</span></span><span><span>为社会主义现代化建设服务，道德品质优良，遵纪守法、身心健康、品德良好，在校期间没有受过纪律处分。学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较好的专业素养，有较强的创新意识和创新能力，有较高的</span></span><span><span>学术</span></span><span><span>潜力</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.全国高校本科</span></span><span><span>三年级</span></span><span><span>在校生（</span><span>2026年毕业），已获得或</span></span><span><span>即将</span></span><span><span>获得所读大学免试推荐研究生资格</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.英语水平良好，原则上达到国家四级425分及以上，或具备同等水平的其他种类外语国家级考试成绩。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>、申请办法</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>网上报名：通过</span><span>“校园学术活动开放日”（网址为https://yzb.jlu.edu.cn/）进行报名。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>报名时间：</span></span><span><span>2025年6月</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>16</span></span><span><span>:00—6月</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>5</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.发送材料：</span></span><span><span>网上提交以下申请材料清晰彩色扫描件或照片的</span></span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span>版，打包成一个压缩文件（压缩包和邮件主题命名格式：姓名</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>申报专业名称</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>开放日</span></span><span><span>），发送至指定邮箱</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>注</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>系统内</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>只</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>显示</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>“</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>区</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>域</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>国别学</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>”</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>专业，</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>下设</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>三个</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>方向</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>，</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>在提交</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>邮件</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>材料</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>时</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>请</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>注明</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>申报</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>方向</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>，如</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>姓名</span><span>-</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>区域国别学（东北亚区域国别政治）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>-</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>开放日</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>申报专业名称</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>电子邮箱</span></span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>世界经济</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>2621779507@qq.com</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>区域经济学</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>2621779507@qq.com</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>人口</span></span><span><span>·</span></span><span><span>资源与环境经济学</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>2621779507@qq.com</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>人口学</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>845208329@qq.com</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>区域国别学（东北亚区域国别经济）</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>845208329@qq.com</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>区域国别学（东北亚区域国别政治）</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>845208329@qq.com</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>区域国别学（东北亚区域国别历史文化）</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>845208329@qq.com</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><span><span>①《</span></span><span><span>校园学术活动开放日申请表</span></span><span><span>》</span></span><span><span>（系统生成）</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>报名系统下载</span></span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span>版，命名格式：</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>申请表</span><span>”；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>②大学成绩单及排名证明</span></span><span><span>，成绩截止至</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>4-2025学年第一学</span></span><span><span>期</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>命名格式：</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>成绩单</span></span><span><span>”；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>③外语等级</span></span><span><span>证书扫描件及其他</span></span><span><span>荣誉等</span></span><span><span>证明材料，命名格式：</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>辅证材料</span><span>”。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.其他要求：</span></span><span><span>纸质版申请材料无需邮寄，保存备查，申请者应对所有申请材料真实性负责</span></span><span><span>。学院只组织第一志愿学生考核。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>、校园学术活动开放日</span></span><span><span>入围名单</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院将于</span></span><span><span>2025年6月30</span></span><span><span>日前在学院官网</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>nasa</span></span><span><span>.jlu.edu.cn</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>上公布</span></span><span><span>进入</span></span><span><span>校园学术活动开放日</span></span><span><span>入围</span></span><span><span>学生名单</span></span><span><span>及考核细则</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五</span></span><span><span>、待遇安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>校园学术活动开放日活动期间，我院为所有学生购买人身意外伤害保险。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.东北亚</span></span><span><span>学院为外地学生提供</span></span><span><span>1晚免费住宿（含早餐）</span></span><span><span>，长春市本地学生不安排住宿，</span></span><span><span>为所有学生</span></span><span><span>提供</span></span><span><span>开放日当天的午餐</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>学生路费自理，如录取为我院</span><span>2026年“推免生”，可按硬卧或高铁</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>等车厢及以下标准凭据实额报销学生高校（或家庭）所在地到长春往返路费，请务必保留好火车票或航空运输电子客票行程单原件。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六</span></span><span><span>、声明</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>为保证校园学术活动开放日活动的质量，我们对学生人数有限制，但仍欢迎未被录取的同学继续报考吉林大学</span></span><span><span>东北亚学院</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>七、联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span>山</span></span><span><span>老师</span> </span><span><span>张</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>0431-851</span></span><span><span>66390</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>吉林大学东北亚学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2025年6月1</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"e4c1928c48291084c19d1abf81965891622015c56bcf27a330e62effb0150ead","textLength":1489,"sourceSha256":"f435c68791ea8f30eedb27c78750c11eabdb6fa53155b14dce3064d4c9b7d541","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-fc714f239307219a1d61","title":"2025年吉林大学东北亚学院“2025年校园学术活动开放日”通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:29.190524+00:00"}
